# The image copies 'setenv.sh' and nothing else. Everything else would only make the
# build context bigger - the test environment above all, which is what changes most
# often and whose logs would otherwise travel to the daemon on every build.
#
# Written as a whitelist on purpose: a new file next to this one is excluded without
# anyone having to remember to add it here.
*
!setenv.sh
!Dockerfile
